        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86428, Tribeca Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tribeca Cabinet Pull is one of the top designs in home decor of this year. This stylish cabinet pull is available in a huge array of sizes from small to large, so you'll be able to add a new Tribeca Pull to all the lightweight doors in your home. The Tribeca Cabinet Pull is available in modern finish color options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Tribeca Transitional Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86428-specifications.pdf?v=1704262414\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Tribeca Cabinet Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86428:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86429:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86489:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86430:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86431:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86490:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86491:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
